            "id": "part-1-group-1",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–5</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the note below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Eco-farm Tour</strong></div><ul><li><strong>Dates offered:</strong> 6–20 June</li><li><strong>Name:</strong> Helen {{1}}</li><li><strong>Email address:</strong> helen123@ {{2}} .com</li><li><strong>Home address:</strong> {{3}} Road, Sheffield</li><li><strong>Source of information:</strong> {{4}}</li><li><strong>Membership number:</strong> {{5}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "part-1-group-2",
            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 6–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the table below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><table class=\"q-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Recommendations</th><th>Customer preferences</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age</strong></td><td>From 16 to 62</td><td>Children: 6 and 4</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accommodation type</strong></td><td>lodges</td><td>a {{6}}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Accommodation location</strong></td><td>Lakeside</td><td>Near the farm or in the {{7}}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Food</strong></td><td>A wide range of food</td><td>Meat, seafood, and {{8}} food</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Transport</strong></td><td>Train or {{9}}</td><td>Ferry and van</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Courses</strong></td><td>Flower planting courses</td><td>Active courses (e.g. a {{10}} course)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "maxWords": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–20</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;How much should visitors tip taxi drivers on the island?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "as much as they feel right"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "no tip at all"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "10% tip"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is mentioned about the medical service on the island?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "It will be charged."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "Visitors should contact their insurance company."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "Visitors have to find the hotel doctor."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The tour guide says the tap water",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "contains no mineral."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "is unsafe."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "has an unusual taste."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What point is made about bottled water?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "It is expensive."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "The bottle is not always sealed."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "It isn't sold everywhere."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What feature is mentioned about the bus on the island?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "frequent"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "not punctual"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "not comfortable"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;How can visitors know the destination of the bus on the island?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "find it in front of the bus"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "check it with the driver"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "find it at the bus stop"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 17,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does the tour guide advise visitors to do before renting a car?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "find a taxi company"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "go to the hotel reception"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "compare the price in advance"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 18,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;When they rent a car, it's important for visitors to know",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "the mileage is limited."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "what is included in the price."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "fuel is included in the price."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 19,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;How can visitors find a taxi easily?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "call the taxi company"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "look for a taxi in advance"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "stop a taxi on the street"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 20,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is suggested by the tour guide about the taxi fee?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "make sure no extra money is asked"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "check what is included in the fee"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "agree the price with the driver in advance"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
